@host = http://localhost:9804/session

### 1. 创建会话
POST {{host}}
X-User: alice

### 2. 第一轮对话
POST {{host}}/ff65a4b2-2b1e-43c6-bddb-cd8b1ba3310f/chat
X-User: alice
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "我国庆想去武汉"
}

### 3. 第二轮对话
POST {{host}}/ff65a4b2-2b1e-43c6-bddb-cd8b1ba3310f/chat
X-User: alice
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "推荐一些特殊美食"
}

### 4. 会话历史查询
GET {{host}}/ff65a4b2-2b1e-43c6-bddb-cd8b1ba3310f/history
X-User: alice


### 5. 异常
GET {{host}}/ff65a4b2-2b1e-43c6-bddb-cd8b1ba3310f/history
X-User: alice1